{"id": "16118a54-ad98-4b53-b23e-e5eebae38d1c", "slug": "financial-infrastructure", "title": "Financial Infrastructure", "description": "Financial Infrastructure Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Financial Infrastructure\"\ndescription: \"Financial Infrastructure Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#0A66C2\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#0F1423\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Financial Infrastructure\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 26; favorites: 9; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, charts, cta.\n## Overview\nFinancial Infrastructure Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nFinStack Start Solutions Features Company Help Create Account Enterprise-grade financial infrastructure built for scale. Start Integration View Pricing Automate complex billing, monitor real-time cash flow, and accept g…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Enterprise-grade financial infrastructure built for scale..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #0A66C2, background #FFFFFF, surface #0F1423, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Geist Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use Geist Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Financial Infrastructure</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #030712; /* Very dark slate */\n            color: #ffffff;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom scrollbar for webkit */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 8px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #030712;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #1f2937;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n\n        /* Floating animation for orbitals */\n        @keyframes float {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }\n        }\n        .animate-float {\n            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n        .animate-float-delayed {\n            animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite;\n            animation-delay: 2s;\n        }\n        .animate-float-slow {\n            animation: float 8s ease-in-out infinite;\n            animation-delay: 1s;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle Light Beam */\n        .light-beam {\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n    </style>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist-mono\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist+Mono:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist-mono\">.font-geist-mono { font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-blue-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Layout & Background -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-center\">\n        <!-- Subtle diagonal texture -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ffffff 0px, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Light Beam -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[80vh] light-beam\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Inner Frame Wrapper (Max width constraint) -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1400px] h-full relative\">\n            <!-- Vertical Guides -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-16 top-0 bottom-0 border-l border-white/[0.04]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-8 md:right-16 top-0 bottom-0 border-r border-white/[0.04]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Horizontal Guides & Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[88px] left-0 right-0 border-b border-white/[0.04]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Corner Brackets (Top Left & Right on guide intersections) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[88px] left-8 md:left-16 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/20 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[88px] right-8 md:right-16 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/20 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Background Vertical Dot accents -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-16 top-1/4 bottom-1/4 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-20 -translate-x-1/2\">\n                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-8 md:right-16 top-1/4 bottom-1/4 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-20 translate-x-1/2\">\n                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Container -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center pt-20 overflow-hidden\">\n        <!-- SVG Orbit Lines -->\n        <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-20\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 800\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" style=\"top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);\">\n            <ellipse cx=\"720\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"400\" ry=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 8\" class=\"text-white/30\"></ellipse>\n            <ellipse cx=\"720\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"550\" ry=\"120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" class=\"text-white/20\"></ellipse>\n            <ellipse cx=\"720\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"700\" ry=\"180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" class=\"text-white/10\"></ellipse>\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-20 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto h-[88px] flex items-center justify-between px-8 md:px-16\">\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white font-geist-mono\">FinStack</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Nav Links (Hidden on small screens) -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist-mono\">Start</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist-mono\">Solutions</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist-mono\">Features</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist-mono\">Company</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist-mono\">Help</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- CTA -->\n        <div>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 bg-white text-black text-sm font-medium rounded-sm hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors duration-200 font-geist-mono\">\n                Create Account\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-end w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-16 pb-16 md:pb-24 pt-32 min-h-[calc(100vh-88px)]\">\n\n        <!-- Floating Orbital Icons (Positioned relative to main container for alignment) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n            <!-- Icon 1 (Top Left) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[25%] left-[25%] animate-float\">\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-white/20 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0f1423] rounded-full p-2.5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:card-send-broken\" class=\"text-gray-300 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Icon 2 (Mid Left) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[45%] left-[20%] animate-float-delayed\">\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/40 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.15)]\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0f1423] rounded-full p-3 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-money-broken\" class=\"text-blue-400 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Icon 3 (Bottom Left) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[60%] left-[30%] animate-float-slow\">\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500/30 to-transparent\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0f1423] rounded-full p-2 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-broken\" class=\"text-orange-400 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Icon 4 (Top Right) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[22%] right-[28%] animate-float-delayed\">\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/30 to-transparent\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0f1423] rounded-full p-2 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pie-chart-2-broken\" class=\"text-purple-400 text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Icon 5 (Mid Right) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[38%] right-[22%] animate-float\">\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.08)]\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-full p-2.5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-broken\" class=\"text-black text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Icon 6 (Bottom Right) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[55%] right-[26%] animate-float-slow\">\n                <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500/40 to-transparent\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#0f1423] rounded-full p-3 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-broken\" class=\"text-indigo-400 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Content Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-end w-full\">\n\n            <!-- Left: Headline & Actions -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"reveal-text text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-white leading-[1.1] max-w-2xl font-geist-mono tracking-tighter font-medium\">\n                    Enterprise-grade financial infrastructure built for scale.\n                </h1>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-[#0a66c2] text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#0056b3]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-geist-mono\">Start Integration</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-broken\" class=\"text-base group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/[0.05] text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-sm hover:bg-white/[0.1] transition-colors duration-200 font-geist-mono\">\n                        View Pricing\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right: Subtitle -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 pb-2\">\n                <p class=\"reveal-text text-base md:text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-md lg:ml-auto font-geist-mono\">\n                    Automate complex billing, monitor real-time cash flow, and accept global transactions effortlessly with our intelligent, secure financial platform.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Setup (Three.js) ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n\n        // Scene, Camera, Renderer\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        camera.position.z = 25;\n        camera.position.y = 5;\n        camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // Group to hold globe and rays\n        const globeGroup = new THREE.Group();\n        scene.add(globeGroup);\n\n        // 1. Globe Particles (Dotted Sphere)\n        const radius = 8;\n        const segments = 64;\n        const rings = 64;\n        const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const vertices = [];\n\n        // Create points on a sphere, filtering some out to look organic\n        for (let i = 0; i < rings; i++) {\n            const phi = (i * Math.PI) / rings;\n            for (let j = 0; j < segments; j++) {\n                const theta = (j * 2 * Math.PI) / segments;\n\n                // Add some noise/randomness to omit points (simulating landmasses roughly)\n                if (Math.random() > 0.4) {\n                    const x = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n                    const y = radius * Math.cos(phi);\n                    const z = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n                    vertices.push(x, y, z);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(vertices, 3));\n\n        // Material for globe dots\n        const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n            color: 0x4a5568, // Grayish blue\n            size: 0.08,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.6,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n\n        const globe = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n        globeGroup.add(globe);\n\n        // 2. Animated Rays/Lines\n        const linesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const linesVertices = [];\n        const rayCount = 100;\n\n        for(let i=0; i<rayCount; i++) {\n            // Start near center\n            const startX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2;\n            const startY = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2;\n            const startZ = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2;\n\n            // End further out\n            const length = Math.random() * 5 + 10;\n            const endX = startX * length;\n            const endY = startY * length;\n            const endZ = startZ * length;\n\n            linesVertices.push(startX, startY, startZ);\n            linesVertices.push(endX, endY, endZ);\n        }\n\n        linesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(linesVertices, 3));\n        const linesMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n            color: 0x2563eb, // Blue accent\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.1,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n\n        const rays = new THREE.LineSegments(linesGeometry, linesMaterial);\n        globeGroup.add(rays);\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Rotate globe\n            globeGroup.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n            globeGroup.rotation.z = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.2) * 0.05;\n\n            // Pulse rays opacity\n            rays.material.opacity = 0.05 + Math.sin(elapsedTime * 2) * 0.05;\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Function to split text into words wrapped in hidden overflow spans\n        function setupTextReveal() {\n            document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text').forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = ''; // Clear original text\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    // Outer wrapper for mask\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                    wrapper.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em'; // Prevent descender clipping\n\n                    // Inner span for animation\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'reveal-word';\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.style.transform = 'translateY(100%)'; // Initial state\n                    inner.innerText = word + '\\u00A0'; // Add non-breaking space\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    el.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n\n                // Create ScrollTrigger animation for this element\n                gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word'), {\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: el,\n                        start: \"top 90%\",\n                        toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                    },\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    stagger: 0.02\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Initialize GSAP after font loads to ensure correct measurements\n        document.fonts.ready.then(() => {\n            setupTextReveal();\n\n            // Fade in buttons\n            gsap.from(\"a.group, a.bg-white\\/\\\\[0\\\\.05\\\\]\", {\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".grid\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\"\n                },\n                y: 20,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"power2.out\",\n                delay: 0.4\n            });\n\n            // Fade in header and guides\n            gsap.from(\"header, .border-white\\/\\\\[0\\\\.04\\\\]\", {\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: \"power2.out\"\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "financial-infrastructure.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/financial-infrastructure.jpg", "source_name": "financial-infrastructure-DESIGN.md", "views": 96, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T09:59:17.793706+00:00"}